attery anymore so that's the Nexus  5 a few months later even though I carry  it I do still recommend the Moto X to a  lot of Android switchers just because it  fits in people's hands better usually  but just because of all the fixes to  some of the biggest software flaws on  the Nexus 5 mainly the camera and  actually the battery this is solidifying  itself as one of the best smartphone  options out there especially because of  the super low price which you just can't  forget about I carry it often with the  Sony rx100 in the other pocket when I  want to take some actually good photos  or sometimes even with the iPhone or  whatever other phone I am testing and a  lot of the other phones and stuff that I  immediately get are just compared to the  Nexus 5 it's the benchmark so there you  have it thanks for watching and I'll  talk to you guys very soon in the next  one peace

